```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    actor H as Hospital User
    participant UI as Streamlit UI
    participant RS as ReservationService
    participant DB as Database (SQLite/PG)
    participant Audit as AuditLog

    H->>UI: Click "Reserve Units" for Request #R
    UI->>RS: make_reservation(request_id=R, lot_id=L, units=N)
    RS->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    RS->>DB: SELECT InventoryLot WHERE id=L
    DB-->>RS: lot (units_total=100, units_reserved=30) → available=70
    RS->>RS: Check: N <= available? (N=20, available=70 → OK)
    RS->>DB: UPDATE inventory_lots SET units_reserved=50 WHERE id=L
    RS->>DB: INSERT INTO reservations (request_id=R, lot_id=L, units=20, status='active')
    RS->>DB: UPDATE emergency_requests SET status='matched' WHERE id=R
    RS->>Audit: INSERT audit_log (action='make_reservation', ...)
    RS->>DB: COMMIT
    DB-->>RS: Success
    RS-->>UI: Reservation object (id=42)
    UI-->>H: ✅ Reserved 20 units (Reservation #42)

    Note over RS,DB: If stock insufficient at commit time:
    RS->>DB: ROLLBACK
    RS-->>UI: ValueError("Insufficient stock")
    UI-->>H: ❌ Error shown to user
```
